flowchart LR
  Browser[React + Vite dashboard and login] -->|HTTPS JSON, HTTP-only cookie| Express[Express API and static build]
  Express --> Auth[Session validation, role checks, warehouse scope]
  Auth --> Provision[Admin provisioning and employee management]
  Express --> Reports[Dashboard, analytics, low-stock alerts, CSV data]
  Express --> Ops[Stock operations and purchase-order receiving]
  Ops -->|Atomic inventory + employee audit rows| SelectDB{DB_DRIVER}
  Reports -->|Prepared parameterized queries| SelectDB
  SelectDB -->|Local development| SQLite[(SQLite through sql.js)]
  SelectDB -->|Production| PostgreSQL[(Neon PostgreSQL over verified TLS)]
  SQLite --> SQLiteSchema[server/schema.sql, additive local migrations]
  PostgreSQL --> PgSchema[server/postgres-schema.sql, PostgreSQL views and constraints]
  Browser -. production hosting .-> Render[Render Free Web Service]
  Render -. HTTPS API and built frontend .-> Express
  SQLite -. one-time verified copy migration .-> PostgreSQL
